;
; MindMods autoload (plan 20 M6/§3.9). The root node is the native `MindMods`
; GDExtension class (mind-gdext), not a script: it scans `user://mods`, persists
; enable flags and exposes the list/import/set_enabled/remove/errors/mod_strings
; API plus `mods_changed`/`mod_error` signals for the plan-14 ModsDialog.
; Declared as a scene so it is editor-navigable and matches the autoload name.

[gd_scene format=3]

[node name="MindMods" type="MindMods"]
